      "translations": {
        "zh_cn": {
          "find": "omniverse.page.arcane_crafter",
          "replace": {
            "text": "像夸克合成器一样，点击空槽可禁用该格，每个红石上升沿制作一次并向正面容器输出；前方无容器时抛出产物。需要放入装有已绑定灵魂核心的法杖，以核心主人的研究校验奥术配方并消耗法杖魔力。魔力充能中继器可为顶端的法杖充能；普通合成配方也可使用。"
          },
          "count": 1
        },
        "en_us": {
          "find": "omniverse.page.arcane_crafter",
          "replace": {
            "text": " Click empty cells to disable them. Each rising redstone edge crafts once into the inventory in front, or ejects the output if no inventory exists. Insert a wand with a bound Soul Core: its owner's live research unlocks arcane recipes, and the wand pays their vis. Relays recharge the wand on top. Ordinary crafting recipes also work."
          },
          "count": 1
        }
      }
